5. PRIVACY

   The application performs all image processing locally, inside the
   visitor's own web browser, using the Canvas API, Web Workers and the
   File System Access API. No image, filename, or other file data is
   transmitted to the Author or to any third party at any time. There is
   no server-side component, no account system, no analytics, and no
   tracking of any kind.


